('MH_LP_QP_CONIC_DANTZIG_WOLFE', 'MF_LP_QP_CONIC', 'M_DANTZIG_WOLFE', 'is_a', 1, 'yes', 'Dantzig-Wolfe decomposition is an algorithm for block-angular linear programs (restricted master LP plus pricing LPs).', 'S135;S139', 'medium', '2026-10-10'),
('MH_LP_QP_CONIC_COLUMN_GENERATION', 'MF_LP_QP_CONIC', 'M_COLUMN_GENERATION', 'is_a', 1, 'yes', 'Column generation solves a linear program with implicit columns by a restricted master LP and a pricing problem; its integer-programming use is branch and price.', 'S136;S139', 'medium', '2026-10-10'),
('MH_DISCRETE_EXACT_BRANCH_PRICE', 'MF_DISCRETE_EXACT', 'M_BRANCH_PRICE', 'is_a', 1, 'yes', 'Branch and price is branch and bound with column-generation node relaxations, classified under Exact discrete and mixed-integer optimization.', 'S137;S139', 'medium', '2026-10-10'),
